---
import FotoJorge from "../../assets/img/FotoJorge.png";
---

<section class="relative py-20 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-[#D946EF]/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full -z-10 pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div
    class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-12 lg:flex-row lg:gap-20"
  >
    <div class="group relative shrink-0">
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 rotate-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#D946EF]/20 bg-[#1E1236]/30 backdrop-blur-sm transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:rotate-12"
      >
      </div>

      <div
        class="relative h-72 w-72 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#D946EF]/50 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(217,70,239,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02] md:h-80 md:w-80"
      >
        <img
          src={FotoJorge.src}
          alt="Foto de Jorge"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#0F0720]/10 mix-blend-overlay"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-1 text-center lg:text-left">
      <h2
        class="mb-6 font-['Outfit'] text-4xl font-bold text-white md:text-5xl"
      >
        Mi nombre es <span
          class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D946EF] to-[#F0ABFC]"
          >Jorge</span
        >
      </h2>

      <div
        class="space-y-6 font-['Outfit'] text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-[#C4B5FD]"
      >
        <p>
          Soy de <span class="font-bold text-white">Extremadura</span> y actualmente
          me desempeño como
          <span class="font-bold text-white">Full Stack Developer</span>, con
          enfoque principal en el <span
            class="font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-[#D946EF]">desarrollo web</span
          >.
        </p>

        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-[#D946EF]/10 bg-[#1E1236]/40 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm text-left"
        >
          <p
            class="mb-3 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D946EF]/70"
          >
            Stack Tecnológico:
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center lg:justify-start">
            {
              [
                "React",
                "Astro",
                "Node.js",
                "Express",
                "PostgreSQL",
                "JavaScript",
                "TypeScript",
              ].map((tech) => (
                <span class="rounded px-2 py-1 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-sm font-medium text-[#D946EF] bg-[#D946EF]/10 border border-[#D946EF]/20">
                  {tech}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          Tengo el grado superior de
          <span class="font-medium text-white border-b border-[#D946EF]/30"
            >ASIR</span
          > (Administración de Sistemas) y
          <span class="font-medium text-white border-b border-[#D946EF]/30"
            >DAM</span
          > (Desarrollo Multiplataforma), por lo tanto tengo conocimientos de varias
          áreas de la informática.
        </p>

        <p>
          Mi área favorita es la <span
            class="font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-[#D946EF]">investigación</span
          > que me hace estar siempre al día en cuanto a las tecnologías que van saliendo.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
